+<a id="assistantreasoning-strip--log-only"></a>
+
+#### `assistant/reasoning-strip` — log-only
+
+```ts persistence-catalog
+/**
+ * Omit rejected reasoning from future model history while preserving original
+ * assistant records. Targets refer to current assistant surface nodes and
+ * strictly increasing reasoning-block indexes in their current projections.
+ * Aligned provider replay entries are removed with the selected blocks.
+ * @messageProjection
+ */
+'assistant/reasoning-strip': { targets: { messageId: MessageId; blockIndexes: number[] }[] }
+```
+
+Source: [`packages/core/session/src/types.ts:364`](../packages/core/session/src/types.ts)
+
+<a id="assistantstream-merge--log-only"></a>
+
+#### `assistant/stream-merge` — log-only
+
+```ts persistence-catalog
+/**
+ * Reconstructs one streamed response from its advertised messages and final
+ * attempt. All references must belong to the same open stream. The first
+ * advertised message retains its identity and receives the complete safe
+ * response; later advertised messages project to empty content.
+ */
+'assistant/stream-merge': {
+  turn: number
+  step: number
+  startSeq: SessionSeq
+  attemptSeq: SessionSeq
+  /** Every advertised message, in original event order; supports bounded replay consumers. */
+  messageSeqs: SessionSeq[]
+  /** Must match the start; retained here for readers loading only the settled suffix. */
+  incompleteBlocks?: 'discard'
+}
+```
+
+Source: [`packages/core/session/src/types.ts:385`](../packages/core/session/src/types.ts)
+
+<a id="assistantstream-start--log-only"></a>
+
+#### `assistant/stream-start` — log-only
+
+```ts persistence-catalog
+/**
+ * Opens one request whose complete blocks may be durably advertised before
+ * the response settles. Required on read, including an unfinished log.
+ * Intermediate assistant messages carry no separate attempt usage.
+ */
+'assistant/stream-start': {
+  turn: number
+  step: number
+  provider: string
+  model: string
+  transport?: 'non-streaming'
+  /** Discard unclosed blocks on an unsuccessful finish; omission preserves historical partial text. */
+  incompleteBlocks?: 'discard'
+}
+```
+
+Source: [`packages/core/session/src/types.ts:370`](../packages/core/session/src/types.ts)
 
