+# 2026-10-05-workflow-cli-merge
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-05-workflow-cli-merge.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Workflow records gain optional member activity, retry attempt, rate-limit deadline and replacement-child identity fields. Usage separates disjoint total tokens from output tokens; saved scripts and cached results remain optional. A subagent-structured-output message source records same-turn schema reminders. A subagent-skill-preload source attributes agent-declared skill instruction messages.
+
