+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+Existing records remain readable because all additions are optional. Session binary versions are unchanged. Workflow journal v2 separately records started invocations; v1 journals load but their older call keys cause recomputation. Readers must retain the new typed user-message source.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+Targeted workflow, tool-workflow and subagent suites exercise recording invariants, durable replay, member retry/skip, measured usage, cancellation and interrupted-sibling recovery.
