+# 2026-10-06-tool-input-rewrite
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-06-tool-input-rewrite.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Adds optional tool/call.effectiveArguments and the tool-input-rewrite message source, preserving original and accepted JSON strings.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
