+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+Existing sessions remain valid at the current writer version. Raw tool/call.arguments remains byte-identical to the authored assistant call, satisfying released V4 relationship validation. Current presentation prefers effectiveArguments; older readers that ignore it display original input. Corrections are ordinary sourced user messages.
