+---
+
+# 2026-10-06-tool-input-rewrite
+
+[English](2026-10-06-tool-input-rewrite.md) | 中文
+
+## 概述
+
+增加可选的 tool/call.effectiveArguments 与 tool-input-rewrite 消息来源，以字符串保留原始与接纳 JSON。
+
+## 目录
+
+- [声明](#declaration)
+- [兼容性](#compatibility)
+- [验证](#verification)
+- [开发备注](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## 声明
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-06-tool-input-rewrite
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:agent/inbox/spliced"
+    previous: "2026-10-05-workflow-cli-merge"
+    after: "b53fa03aadd57d3ec1f2faab53328b045002863ee558c8f0d766a09593d9290c"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:developer/message"
+    previous: "2026-10-05-workflow-cli-merge"
+    after: "eab104cb5afd7d66d694d4c12753fe67b4f646e994ccc80b70eb1904af1abdc1"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:session/title-llm-request"
+    previous: "2026-10-05-workflow-cli-merge"
+    after: "fcc091c77f8496b9e48fdb76ae5a0a8948b9f566f11204cb4c554458bd034f40"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:tool/call"
+    previous: "2026-09-11-initial"
+    after: "76a84a664dd2e37c98b7a94721ab17d4c9852b17e7f453c04622c7920941477c"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:user/message"
+    previous: "2026-10-05-workflow-cli-merge"
+    after: "85bb764337246598782781b8c635b236bfd87e1c1638e9b4e2492778e8c4c79b"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## 兼容性
+
+已有会话在当前写入版本下仍有效。原始 tool/call.arguments 与助手原始调用逐字节一致，保留已发布 V4 关系校验。当前展示优先采用 effectiveArguments；忽略此字段的旧读取方显示原始输入。更正使用带来源的普通用户消息。
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## 验证
+
+965 项工具、agent-loop、Claude hook 与本地代理测试通过。34 项 Lab 展示测试通过，包括接纳命令的渲染与回放。
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## 开发备注
+
+无。
