+# 2026-10-06-workflow-admissions
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-06-workflow-admissions.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Records queued workflow calls and failures before child publication.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-06-workflow-admissions
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:tool-workflow/agent-admission"
+    previous: null
+    after: "ba447abeb4ceecd5d7bccf288e147b7c03a79dfe18c6d5dceddf22ff28130aec"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+Adds the ordinary required-on-read tool-workflow/agent-admission event without changing existing event payloads or the Session envelope. New readers accept existing logs; old readers lacking this event reject newly written logs. No writer version bump or data rewrite is required.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+Twenty real PTC admission tests pass against eighteen local Claude CLI fixtures, including pending concurrency and provider startup failure; seventy-seven App tests pass.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
