+
+English | [中文](2026-10-06-workflow-child-tools.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Adds optional exact-name tool exclusions to persisted subagent composition.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-06-workflow-child-tools
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:subagent/descriptor"
+    previous: "2026-09-11-initial"
+    after: "9260512bdbf7a38ce3350c40d39ad44dd40c3b1e57c1d95661bb4c07a72088bd"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+Existing records remain valid because exclude is optional. Updated readers retain exclusions during cold resume and enforce them against inherited, own and later registrations. Older readers reject the new descriptor field; downgrade reading is not supported.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+Focused tool, Workflow and spawn tests passed except two fixture issues corrected in whole-file retests; service descriptor tests passed (46), and continuation-inheritance passed (12), including denial before and after cold resume.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
