+# 2026-10-06-workflow-resume-attempt
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-06-workflow-resume-attempt.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Adds an optional attemptId to all durable Workflow records so repeated executions of one run ID remain distinct.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-06-workflow-resume-attempt
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:tool-workflow/agent-end"
+    previous: "2026-10-05-workflow-cli-merge"
+    after: "b172d9ffea8119046c22aa522e6f90ca2bdf0c54ef0ba4b959151a3a37f69a8c"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:tool-workflow/agent-progress"
+    previous: "2026-10-05-workflow-cli-merge"
+    after: "dcd6b9b8e55bb1c7f459c29ed6954d9871cd300a695e7f0747b8bc7f9dee4efa"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:tool-workflow/agent-start"
+    previous: "2026-10-05-workflow-cli-merge"
+    after: "e4e2ca01bebfd5f5c89c575c51cc37f2925635248ba0a10260cc10b0d055dd0d"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:tool-workflow/phase"
+    previous: "2026-10-05-workflow-cli-merge"
+    after: "b8e88e01ba245847b597bd79b90e00d8401bc6cf04267429e02bcfc05187c2ee"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:tool-workflow/run-end"
+    previous: "2026-10-05-workflow-cli-merge"
+    after: "bc7a5829e741b219967b2f1f61f8cbf2e2a11020ffe57ecc93b8bef754ec3835"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:tool-workflow/run-start"
+    previous: "2026-10-05-workflow-cli-merge"
+    after: "3055b03cd58b287a2f7014eddd10af3748590176cc5e3f824b2ca26160d59767"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+Existing records remain valid and use runId as their execution key. New PTC records include attemptId; current consumers route by that field. Older readers can misassociate resumed runs and are not supported for new histories. The session envelope version is unchanged.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+Workflow source tests, durable record invariant tests, client node tests and the authored workflow-resume-attempt Loader snapshot exercise stable run identity, separate execution records and saved-path reuse.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
