 ### Design philosophy
 
-- **A compatibility adapter, not a power tool.** The bridge exists to run the explicitly supported command-hook subset of an existing Claude Code config; bespoke behavior belongs in a native plugin on the same extension points.
+- **A compatibility adapter, not a power tool.** The bridge exists to run the explicitly supported command and HTTP subset of an existing Claude Code config; bespoke behavior belongs in a native plugin on the same extension points.
