+Omitting `run_in_background` starts a background job by default. Set it to false or configure `defaultRunInBackground: false` for synchronous callers. Name lookup checks project ancestors and user workflows; enabled plugin workflows use the `plugin:name` namespace and include manifest paths. Nested name/path calls use the same resolver.
