+ * @param signal - Caller cancellation during filesystem reads.
+ * @param cwd - Calling Session's working directory.
+ * @param authorize - Owner's Read admission, called before resolution and again with the canonical path before reading bytes.
+ * @returns The parsed body and optional literal metadata.
