+---
+description: "Records a persistence type transition and its compatibility acknowledgement."
+kind: persistence-change
+---
+
+# 2026-10-06-streaming-text-recovery
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-06-streaming-text-recovery.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Records matching optional incompleteBlocks policies on streaming start and merge events and declares the stream-recovery instruction source.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-06-streaming-text-recovery
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:agent/inbox/spliced"
+    previous: "2026-10-06-tool-input-rewrite"
+    after: "6da0dd6340a5914963b88695751c940069dc6ff57f98c74125a7252dab9ce167"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:assistant/stream-merge"
+    previous: "2026-10-06-streaming-tool-history"
+    after: "1d5e0bdb859f386718f3b1fb8ebee7cf24427b8235ec10c023e8cbee94da87d9"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:assistant/stream-start"
+    previous: "2026-10-06-streaming-tool-history"
+    after: "ec608ac93a3067b0fe6f91de0b40e7ee4248f351bd46549ceedd0a8c1c5077e1"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:developer/message"
+    previous: "2026-10-06-tool-input-rewrite"
+    after: "3d200a1ab0ec82826a2c09f5250878f07ee75466ae5de3c5f448264294620314"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:session/title-llm-request"
+    previous: "2026-10-06-tool-input-rewrite"
+    after: "a0bc94df4276e6fa20e671513d9ce9d5cfb92442606bdf83b246d53b24d2d146"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:user/message"
+    previous: "2026-10-06-tool-input-rewrite"
+    after: "af711cc08ccc370297afa1b89387518f78a596e7cc739b0c365ad46b3251b297"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+Omitted policies retain historical partial-text reconstruction. New writers record discard on both markers; current readers validate equality and exclude unsuccessful unclosed blocks without altering full attempts. Settled suffix readers use the merge policy. Old streaming readers must be upgraded together. V4 headers and released codecs are unchanged.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+Focused streaming, Session restoration, child output, UI, SDK and token-meter checks passed 323 tests in 13 files. A later TypeScript SDK run passed 48 tests; three Python protocol cases include a recorded Loader child. All 30 Workflow Loader scenarios replay, and all three corpus checks pass. Current 32-package installation matches six complete recovery suffixes and four mixed text/tool instruction policies against the pinned Claude CLI. Lab bridge checks pass 58 tests; four browser checks and 12 offscreen Workflow UI checks pass. Counts overlap and do not imply full parity.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
