+# 2026-10-07-claude-request-retry
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-07-claude-request-retry.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Adds optional providerRetryable to LlmFailure so a provider can distinguish recoverable HTTP authentication and gateway failures without changing stable error codes.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-07-claude-request-retry
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:assistant/attempt"
+    previous: "2026-10-07-reasoning-recovery"
+    after: "9df6ef29be1be869029afa0ae9a6acf56257ae85318d9bb974557a91f9f01298"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:assistant/message"
+    previous: "2026-10-07-legacy-reasoning-order"
+    after: "6a52f601dd9e3ad6a2a1b712a0c011327d25d76ad97482e66d2e1e6fc479553a"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:llm/retry"
+    previous: "2026-10-07-reasoning-recovery"
+    after: "2c121f178055e3bad7dae6ef1666cb8ca2d1ffe2f5e4ed111261f93d02bdde00"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:turn/end"
+    previous: "2026-10-07-reasoning-recovery"
+    after: "4ba5ab6f9f80a6d36c4a44af5e26ea8336e202d00eb0dc328292489e080ad0a0"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+The Session writer remains V4. Older records omit the boolean and keep code-based eligibility. New readers retain true and false decisions in raw failure payloads; only explicitly selected retry strategies consume them. Existing records require no rewrite.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+Focused policy, adapter, and retry tests cover boolean preservation, ordinary HTTP eligibility, bounded retries, jitter, and Retry-After. A new authored CLI Session fixture records recovery from an HTTP 401 failure.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
