+---
+description: "Records a persistence type transition and its compatibility acknowledgement."
+kind: persistence-change
+---
+
+# 2026-10-07-legacy-reasoning-order
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-07-legacy-reasoning-order.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Adds optional provider-neutral reasoningPrefix metadata to model message sources. Session omission projections reconstruct it from original content, including legacy records.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-07-legacy-reasoning-order
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:agent/inbox/spliced"
+    previous: "2026-10-06-streaming-text-recovery"
+    after: "048d2427d10be44c0f1b44ee0543840cd5ca3eee8f91fe4bf8fecc3dde9e0943"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:assistant/message"
+    previous: "2026-10-07-reasoning-recovery"
+    after: "e34a3eb7e398a53ace703ef357cc0b6aa66cfa5a134d5c61398e621bcbe718fe"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:developer/message"
+    previous: "2026-10-06-streaming-text-recovery"
+    after: "f2a9fb9283e66ce59bae27c635470d4ce4a77523a89383577e798e2bdd8b9ce8"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:session/title-llm-request"
+    previous: "2026-10-06-streaming-text-recovery"
+    after: "cfb35dfb7be322ad2c64e6f4bc7881fb6f2479a33fc475a8f93d287ebe38f254"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:user/message"
+    previous: "2026-10-06-streaming-text-recovery"
+    after: "378a5f485b579ed8cb9374ec296d4cc51cc513956e8fc37cb9cf7cfd298a5fea"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+The Session writer remains V4. Existing records remain valid and need no rewrite. Source metadata preserves original reasoning positions without provider payloads; request adapters omit those positions only after merging blocks. Readers and adapters must update together to retain tool order for old mixed responses. No committed generation changes.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+1284 focused Session, AgentLoop, Messages, message-value, and TypeScript SDK tests passed. An installed-reader probe against three exported Workflow sessions with old metadata reproduces the original ordering failure before the fix.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
