+---
+description: "记录持久化类型更改及其兼容性确认。"
+kind: persistence-change
+---
+
+# 2026-10-07-legacy-reasoning-order
+
+[English](2026-10-07-legacy-reasoning-order.md) | 中文
+
+## 概述
+
+为模型消息来源添加可选的提供方无关 reasoningPrefix 元数据。Session 省略投影从原始内容重建计数，也适用于旧记录。
+
+## 目录
+
+- [声明](#declaration)
+- [兼容性](#compatibility)
+- [验证](#verification)
+- [开发备注](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## 声明
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-07-legacy-reasoning-order
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:agent/inbox/spliced"
+    previous: "2026-10-06-streaming-text-recovery"
+    after: "048d2427d10be44c0f1b44ee0543840cd5ca3eee8f91fe4bf8fecc3dde9e0943"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:assistant/message"
+    previous: "2026-10-07-reasoning-recovery"
+    after: "e34a3eb7e398a53ace703ef357cc0b6aa66cfa5a134d5c61398e621bcbe718fe"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:developer/message"
+    previous: "2026-10-06-streaming-text-recovery"
+    after: "f2a9fb9283e66ce59bae27c635470d4ce4a77523a89383577e798e2bdd8b9ce8"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:session/title-llm-request"
+    previous: "2026-10-06-streaming-text-recovery"
+    after: "cfb35dfb7be322ad2c64e6f4bc7881fb6f2479a33fc475a8f93d287ebe38f254"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:user/message"
+    previous: "2026-10-06-streaming-text-recovery"
+    after: "378a5f485b579ed8cb9374ec296d4cc51cc513956e8fc37cb9cf7cfd298a5fea"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## 兼容性
+
+Session 写入格式保持 V4。已有记录仍有效且无需改写。来源元数据不含提供方载荷，仅保留原始思考位置；请求适配器在合并块后才省略相应位置。须一起更新读取方和适配器，以保留旧混合响应的工具顺序。不改变已提交的历史 generation。
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## 验证
+
+1284 项针对 Session、AgentLoop、Messages、消息值和 TypeScript SDK 的测试通过。安装版读取器对三个导出 Workflow 旧元数据会话的探针复现了修复前的顺序错误。
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## 开发备注
+
+无。
