+---
+description: "Records a persistence type transition and its compatibility acknowledgement."
+kind: persistence-change
+---
+
+# 2026-10-07-reasoning-recovery
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-07-reasoning-recovery.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Adds required assistant/reasoning-strip decisions and optional provider-neutral reasoningRecovery facts to failed model attempts.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-07-reasoning-recovery
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:assistant/attempt"
+    previous: "2026-09-16-session-format-v4"
+    after: "17c8bbd746cd626d940cfd1332714106056cf2f615036b2d4f6703d4bb372cc2"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:assistant/message"
+    previous: "2026-09-16-session-format-v4"
+    after: "1ed51f91134835424de9e0e1614adcf0c351936c0639b44cee199371b8325d26"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:assistant/reasoning-strip"
+    previous: null
+    after: "8fcf4c192bbc2b492c201cac9bb1255849fac628a2bc40df334ce13b4257a27b"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:llm/retry"
+    previous: "2026-09-14-image-offload"
+    after: "36f3d5debe68b8c80fd4c66edebc75ac80f87a1855c0c16423266e0c3d4171f5"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:turn/end"
+    previous: "2026-09-16-session-format-v4"
+    after: "14a2dc768ec40696a774f03a286369c046f2778eee82fa9d0dca135ebc605285"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+Same physical Session V4. Existing events remain valid; new readers preserve original responses while projecting only the recorded reasoning omissions. Older readers reject the new required event instead of replaying rejected content. Released codecs and committed Session generations are unchanged.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+63 focused projection, buffered/streaming recovery and adapter classification tests pass. Native CLI probes cover complete and indexed removal, repeated prefix errors and process restoration.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
